   "The service coordinator may prepare the report reconciliation packet, but pricing, service commitments, credits, and client concessions stay with the service lead. The escalation record names the impact, the severity, the owner, the response time, and the next communication date. For report reconciliation, the written sequence ends with a named reviewer and a date before the service lead releases the result. Outsourced Service records this step with the request ID, the SLA clock, the service reviewer, and the destination ticket system; case note 7 stays with the service record.",
   "## The daily report reconciliation routine",
